    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0266" n="192" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg192"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/525</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Odessa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Odessa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-16T18:00:00+02:02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 16, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 18, 11.40
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On receipt of the news of conflict between Kornilov and Kerensky a revolutionary
                    committee composed of laborers and soldiers took over the power here, the
                    general commanding Odessa acceding to this. These <hi rendition="#italic">de
                        facto</hi> authorities have since declared themselves in favor of peace even
                    at the cost of a break with the Allies and last night voted lack of confidence
                    in the head of the Provisional Government on account of his army policy and
                    organized to-day a peace parade. So far there have been no serious disorders
                    although there are several small strikes on.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
